  "recipeDetail": "Comments from the Creator\n\"Clear Portrait\" is a recipe designed to create portraits full of transparency. It maintains contrast so that it is not too faint, and adjusts saturation to vibrant levels. It creates a refreshing impression on sunny days and a calm finish on cloudy days. It creates soft impressions and is a perfect match for photographs that take advantage of bokeh, and can be applied to snapshots and tabletop photography. Adjusting the exposure slightly higher than the optimal value will give a clearer impression. The color temperature can be set to auto, but you may also try a slightly cooler finish with a bluish tint.",
